  << The boxed float plus the java.lang.Float static API as instance methods.
     The VM has no binary32 primitive, so a float is carried as a double that
     has been rounded to binary32 (fround: 24-bit significand, round half even,
     overflow to infinity, gradual underflow), which makes every value, bit
     view (floatToIntBits / intBitsToFloat) and toString exactly the Java
     float result. >>
